  (text "MicroMod processor card edge: SparkFun MicroMod Teensy pinout (docs/PINOUT.md)." (at 25.4 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 6aacfa7f-4ccf-5bc8-b277-90fbb8c8b67c))
  (text "Pins 13/15/21/23 carry SAI4 (AUD2) instead of RTS1/CTS1/SWDCK/SWDIO; SWD is on bottom test pads TP1/TP2 (TP3 RESET#, TP4 BOOT#, TP5 SAI4_MCLK); fixture power comes through the M.2 socket." (at 25.4 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 49f50999-4543-5231-92ff-373fc41342cc))
  (text "RESET# -> U2 manual reset; U2 holds POR_B low through power-up (open drain, POR_B has an internal 100k pull-up)." (at 25.4 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 4bc74202-c23f-5460-baa5-1aabdf1b4fb5))
  (text "BOOT# -> BOOT_MODE1 and, inverted by U3, BOOT_MODE0: released = 10 internal boot, held = 01 USB serial downloader." (at 25.4 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.778)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 70c0385f-2365-50e0-8e1a-b55b0c459cc8))
